#: scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b157f384cc1a276907d2c984e68b8ae2a7d44da3b74ef43de996449f01d07b93
#. default-sha256: 83626181574756f06e9aeaf827e376784b3ed2acf5a2c7977bbcb8b1a589849c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Several days passed by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫저와 ⟪k:13⟫베스티아의 시간은 "
"그 후로 얼마 정도 ⟪k:14⟫지났습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d959ad32273d94a81c51cb4dc6169589590fa7c385f5f9b4a64942b193ed122
#. default-sha256: 78fd25e5f875caf1928e8c8080e407e4f5c8c1d62f40e084473448169bd2e934
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As Bestia began to act more like a person, the mansion followed suit, slowly becoming more "
"habitable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not yet back to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫베스티아가 인간성을 익혀 가니, ⟪k:1⟫저택도 점차 ⟪k:2⟫과거의 영광에는 못 미쳐도…… ⟪k:3⟫사람이 "
"사는 환경으로 돌아왔습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c5cc52959f31a1de94271e4e9409c76b09e665d28c5b99ec79b0fc5271873be
#. default-sha256: b15c9ab5ef185c9e06299fa17b8f3ea58d3bc427b39b75e2d597dd3229d29a58
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No flowers grew in the garden, but neither were there weeds infesting it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫정원에는 역시 꽃 한 송이 없지만, ⟪k:1⟫잡초밭 상태에서는 벗어났고,"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e9c1c2702ac187da0e4ce49a18a95258a5e0d49f24fe077e94d39a69fbeb4ad
#. default-sha256: d4808c2fa0cee25a7310461b7d4855e72c7b57874658809b868581a145154a04
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The dusty corridors, shattered windows, rust-covered kitchen gradually returned to their "
"proper states."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫먼지가 수북하던 복도와 깨진 창문, ⟪k:1⟫녹슨 주방도 ⟪k:2⟫조금씩 원래대로 돌아왔습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2db787cf75b15308bfb03d5554e8d4d6296c8a3f866e7458fc9aa0cd66849f69
#. default-sha256: 1df5f88ef91ce0245cd4eb68e7ff592206762a7f0855b1ee6d9c6fa14d053017
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia learned how to change his own clothes, and how to draw a bath."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 옷을 갈아입는 법을 익혔고, ⟪k:1⟫물을 끓이는 법도 익혔습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b79e91b13694fad2e2d412e11307267391de8cfd9f85c4c73362ce7f4d9416a
#. default-sha256: ee08101f9152cfd079ceb49c424e2fbd95b240de92d46ea339f2f159e59c0f84
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer did I have to wait on him hand and foot; he could take care of a number of things "
"all by himself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 전부 돌보지 않아도 ⟪k:1⟫혼자서 많은 게 가능해졌지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 832fc36bebdc576aa335791fbad98698db5590fe881a63ae5eb879d5b3f9c09d
#. default-sha256: bf3d20166d4508f8ec5708ef8d284106eab5cc441b4703cfa89c054876f2f533
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What we lacked for food, he acquired from the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫부족한 식량은 ⟪k:1⟫베스티아가 숲에서 잡아왔습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b6d47570f91cd8ad6001499c1a30cec3c97f4fc97fdf6d669aaef0999b522ce
#. default-sha256: 6e7e2804d31490fd6629d088c950e0f298a82a0ac6958a231df9d83c0dbd0afc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Never did he go to purchase supplies from the village; rather, he captured hares and "
"gathered herbs hidden in the overgrowth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫결코 장을 보러 마을로 가진 않았으며, ⟪k:1⟫수풀 사이로 나타나는 멧토끼나 ⟪k:2⟫잡초 사이에 자"
"란 멧나물 등을 ⟪k:3⟫챙겨 왔습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 574e32e28ac5d1b21bb212930cd8245acc43af34adf0c4b45bf09305ba9d9e66
#. default-sha256: 852630c15f331f50a810f7adb803551d92d016d65e86a864fedff7cbd22bcb7d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were days without incident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무것도 없는 시간이었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3cd8071161f25d83acdc9e51a392af5a159cefa1c87e9b5f370c3afaafe2dfd
#. default-sha256: 3a0904d8d8174fb55eb9c30cecee8da3a9599589d4465abd52ac05b1ca35ea85
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And though such a life may be want for excitement,⟪k:1⟫peace is something that you mustn’t "
"take for granted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무것도 없는 것……, ⟪k:1⟫그러나 그건 ⟪k:2⟫귀중한 평온이었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4824209ffba4f8ab25d87b74034db115845f121204f75b43a18a9f8b975c809b
#. default-sha256: 84d06693a3a8a46a99d176f3efcd26dc3188b04cdb59e9654c017482c0aa5e50
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those who have it cast it aside, finding the leisurely flow of time dull.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Only "
"those who have never experienced it truly know how precious it is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫가진 자는 따분하다며 버릴 ⟪k:1⟫완만한 시간.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫못 가진 자만이 ⟪k:4⟫가치를 아는 것."

#: scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b4c44649b4fb11e988f4a04673a0382ba1d494aa9ef13437f88d245b70e5147
#. default-sha256: 460723aeb489dc3ceff62ec5c3b9aed4a3d32276ebfa7d9d860640453f7de0b0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia appeared to be content.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He wore an expression of solitary serenity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 ⟪k:1⟫만족스러워 보였습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫베스티아에게는 고독한 행복이 넘실거렸지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faeb828f7520270bce9d3ec324891c38dc5dc3f30f6d2b1275cff0b5cf0467af
#. default-sha256: 7c58b0c1485dfa54ee4376f9be683c89ba799198430056790c82ec6bb2039f4e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is anyone there?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫누구……, ⟪k:2⟫누구 ⟪k:3⟫없소!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8db4850a3fae9d667bcf3e862af6e7337a00c556c5ce3c23fc0f03c3b286ad89
#. default-sha256: 1a09ccde2bb54cf8535f1bc40335805372bc0dd9ea45866173b3beab6df0bda5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, a crack formed in the uneventful tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무것도 없던 평온에 ⟪k:1⟫금이 간 것은 바로 그 날이었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1b83091e38386139cc70c55b372125a0c8357bb3bddeaa89a9fa1cc4c67ba43
#. default-sha256: 6bd3f3dbac80ad5a71d9173354798444021369944fc98afd571de9d69e2d5b30
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Is anyone... ⟪k:1⟫in there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you part with some food?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t need "
"much..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구…… 없소?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫조금이어도 되니 ⟪k:3⟫식량을 나누어 주시오……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d388003124fa13606007c48e91db8543430cd31c5c072d2f827f302085ee8a81
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 861978798937770c6b186ccf7b932b388463a738f6b1bb5d5fa0aaed64e64bbb
#. default-sha256: cc7e99154657589776ecbda5a7774c5f22da3146b816dd8f5619a5d1c40dd82e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Some food and water...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just a little... ⟪k:4⟫that’s all I need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아주 조금……, ⟪k:2⟫조금이어도 되니 ⟪k:3⟫물과 ⟪k:4⟫식량을……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23aad97e44015839293baa1834a832270960534d14f3e4a6ac6069472273df1c
#. default-sha256: 9adb23c2cace7e285bdca026819c1218a3e0373d511ff67efdaa56335289acd3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia looked over at me, as if seeking my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 ⟪k:1⟫구원을 청하듯 저를 바라보았습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eae45b61bd24fee227ef6b42c1946a990fc9ca5a389d4a748cc25ae4ef6ba5d7
#. default-sha256: 1f70f012f20a48756748943d04c4be491e0e3a79ed6c9a5ef8b977ef85197a9e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ironic, no? It was the visitor who was truly in need of aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫참 이상하지 않은지요?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫구원을 청하는 것은 방문자인데 말이지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7ba685593f3ca2acf4e0e15ae214343db256ffa128f3feb73cbdaefa172a018
#. default-sha256: 9db1fd9d4b258252c3729dc49df3c45e61fe41954a30402dbbc5b7a1faa9d854
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I pondered it for a few moments, deciding that I could not simply turn away someone calling "
"upon the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 잠시 고민했으나 ⟪k:1⟫저택을 찾아온 이를 홀대할 수도 없었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44db777d16accb8961cf935e61cecbd10b29039ce40ae9305a94bc5f8f6727ff
#. default-sha256: 3fd530aa413cae65038efa4a7744c64ec4a2cbc6110d25f85e4f5beaf2daa995
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Bestia ordered me to not let him in, I would have followed his instructions, but he said "
"nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아가 들이지 말라고 했다면 ⟪k:1⟫그 말을 따랐겠지만, ⟪k:2⟫아무 말도 안 했거든요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eabd324867b26be55e2283d1fc0bd0bd81f1689725990f6266d13bc3c0edca2
#. default-sha256: 40068d5d6aa7f60c375c2e9b8fc3dbdc4a986d9c4c7423bb3fd8377e59eb20c2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, thank God... ⟪k:9⟫someone’s here.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I "
"was afraid it was deserted..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫아아, ⟪k:9⟫살았군……. ⟪k:10⟫사람이 있나.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫나"
"는 또 아무도 없는 줄……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7787242b117d843f25af3298858c001be883592c3e5901cb3b8c531cae110fcb
#. default-sha256: 715c292d95ef61ec9105a773dc2eed3e800fe9a3fe25b521bde1674bc33c521b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said you were in need of sustenance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………….⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫식량을 원한다셨지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c740aa088b46bc1ff8554da4a8196af05a118150af43b66ddf239b5013c4d056
#. default-sha256: c2b05b87c0d381ead7086e2381a788053a5f646c6607f1ff410572fd074acf4a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It doesn’t have to be much.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything to quench this thirst..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫맞소…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아주 조금이어도 되오. ⟪k:4⟫목을 축일 게 있다면 ⟪k:5⟫뭐든……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
